{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with a quiet room. A television flickers. An apartment door creaks open. Something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous author Janus Brennhart is giving an interview right after his latest book. The interview takes him to old days and stories some of which he doesn\u2019t recall now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Remains and The Residue</i> is short atmospheric puzzle-adventure game that invites players to explore stories and memories of the famous author Janus Brennhart. Through fragmented stories, you\u2019ll piece together a narrative where fiction seems to bleed into the real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich adventure with different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay, about 1-2 hours</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959400?t=1756224839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959400/f94679f97793bb9f4b61a615804bba79f67ad17f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756224839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959400/e724067df18c19f2862992a124f65d953cb57533/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756224839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959400/e724067df18c19f2862992a124f65d953cb57533/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756224839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains scenes that depicts self-harm and violence which some players might find disturbing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with a quiet room. A television flickers. An apartment door creaks open. Something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous author Janus Brennhart is giving an interview right after his latest book. The interview takes him to old days and stories some of which he doesn\u2019t recall now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Remains and The Residue</i> is short atmospheric puzzle-adventure game that invites players to explore stories and memories of the famous author Janus Brennhart. Through fragmented stories, you\u2019ll piece together a narrative where fiction seems to bleed into the real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-rich adventure with different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay, about 1-2 hours</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fatih Mert"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959400/9d862efde771d76b17f3382be3ce7e69b6b700cf/header.jpg?t=1756224839","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959400/211380037/4b2e0fc2e8e4e55c997826148012d0d52fc1d587/1755435386/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755703207","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959400/211380037/4b2e0fc2e8e4e55c997826148012d0d52fc1d587/1755435386/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755703207","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959400/211380037/4b2e0fc2e8e4e55c9978261480